# context-compaction

Apply the context-compaction skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- diagnose context pressure in a running session
- compact a conversation window with a structured summary
- clear stale tool results and re-derive them on demand
- hand off a session across a compaction boundary

Stop when: The session continues with a fresh window, every durable artifact preserved, and every dropped item either re-derivable or recorded as a risk.
